      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Patterns and limits\n\u2022 Context object + scope guard: temporary state, restored on exit.\n\u2022 Adapter implements ports: callers avoid file/vendor decisions.\n\u2022 Activity/Meter are .NET instrumentation, not custom patterns.\n\u2022 Observer is one installed destination, not subscriber fan-out.",
      "originalText": "Patterns and limits\n\u2022 Context object + scope guard: temporary state, restored on exit.\n\u2022 Adapter implements ports: callers avoid file/vendor decisions.\n\u2022 Activity/Meter are .NET instrumentation, not custom patterns.\n\u2022 Observer is one installed destination, not subscriber fan-out.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
