      "updated": 1792000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Transactional outbox pattern\nBusiness rows + evidence + delivery intent commit together.\nDelivery happens afterward, with leases and recoverable retry.\nAt-least-once delivery: stable event ID supports deduplication.\nLocal ACK and cloud ACK remain independent.\nCloud adapter is deferred; no cloud class is implemented.",
      "originalText": "Transactional outbox pattern\nBusiness rows + evidence + delivery intent commit together.\nDelivery happens afterward, with leases and recoverable retry.\nAt-least-once delivery: stable event ID supports deduplication.\nLocal ACK and cloud ACK remain independent.\nCloud adapter is deferred; no cloud class is implemented.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
